    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/2a8654ca4ab8703f30caf358200d4684.poster.avif?t=1716399009\" width=614 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/2a8654ca4ab8703f30caf358200d4684.webm?t=1716399009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/2a8654ca4ab8703f30caf358200d4684.mp4?t=1716399009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>ENDS</strong> is a single-player game set in the Pembridge Estate in London, which faces imminent demolition by the local council. Players take on the role of Rahim, navigating his life alongside friends Sonny and Reece. The narrative explores the challenges and choices of urban life, contrasting the realities of different social classes.<br><br>With sandbox and RPG elements, players immerse themselves in a gritty crime drama, experiencing realistic and grounded gameplay elements. It\u2019s a coming-of-age story that delves into the complexities of brotherhood, family, and loyalty.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/7505dd9bf7ff543b1a872f017fe14cc9.poster.avif?t=1716399009\" width=614 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/7505dd9bf7ff543b1a872f017fe14cc9.webm?t=1716399009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/7505dd9bf7ff543b1a872f017fe14cc9.mp4?t=1716399009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Engage in intense melee and hand-to-hand combat, making use of environmental attacks and grappling for diverse confrontations.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Stay connected with an in-game phone containing key information like the map and access to radio stations.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Navigate parts of London with bicycles, mopeds and a range of vehicles or take the train for a faster option.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/084fe1f616c7853c642fce08e6ebfdbe.poster.avif?t=1716399009\" width=614 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/084fe1f616c7853c642fce08e6ebfdbe.webm?t=1716399009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/084fe1f616c7853c642fce08e6ebfdbe.mp4?t=1716399009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REAL LIFE BRANDS</h2>Explore in-game shops featuring real brands ranging from clothing to food and beverages allowing an immersive experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIVERSE SIDE ACTIVITIES</h2>Enjoy a variety of replayable side missions and meet strangers through random encounters across the city.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DECISIONS CARVE DESTINY</h2>Your decisions serve as the guiding stars driving the storyline. From minor interactions to key events, each choice shapes the direction of the narrative.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/ff3e8e6d85c96611e77676f3bddf61ff.poster.avif?t=1716399009\" width=614 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/ff3e8e6d85c96611e77676f3bddf61ff.webm?t=1716399009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/ff3e8e6d85c96611e77676f3bddf61ff.mp4?t=1716399009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/2a8654ca4ab8703f30caf358200d4684.poster.avif?t=1716399009\" width=614 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/2a8654ca4ab8703f30caf358200d4684.webm?t=1716399009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/2a8654ca4ab8703f30caf358200d4684.mp4?t=1716399009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>ENDS</strong> is a single-player game set in the Pembridge Estate in London, which faces imminent demolition by the local council. Players take on the role of Rahim, navigating his life alongside friends Sonny and Reece. The narrative explores the challenges and choices of urban life, contrasting the realities of different social classes.<br><br>With sandbox and RPG elements, players immerse themselves in a gritty crime drama, experiencing realistic and grounded gameplay elements. It\u2019s a coming-of-age story that delves into the complexities of brotherhood, family, and loyalty.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/7505dd9bf7ff543b1a872f017fe14cc9.poster.avif?t=1716399009\" width=614 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/7505dd9bf7ff543b1a872f017fe14cc9.webm?t=1716399009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/7505dd9bf7ff543b1a872f017fe14cc9.mp4?t=1716399009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Engage in intense melee and hand-to-hand combat, making use of environmental attacks and grappling for diverse confrontations.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Stay connected with an in-game phone containing key information like the map and access to radio stations.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Navigate parts of London with bicycles, mopeds and a range of vehicles or take the train for a faster option.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/084fe1f616c7853c642fce08e6ebfdbe.poster.avif?t=1716399009\" width=614 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/084fe1f616c7853c642fce08e6ebfdbe.webm?t=1716399009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/084fe1f616c7853c642fce08e6ebfdbe.mp4?t=1716399009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REAL LIFE BRANDS</h2>Explore in-game shops featuring real brands ranging from clothing to food and beverages allowing an immersive experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIVERSE SIDE ACTIVITIES</h2>Enjoy a variety of replayable side missions and meet strangers through random encounters across the city.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DECISIONS CARVE DESTINY</h2>Your decisions serve as the guiding stars driving the storyline. From minor interactions to key events, each choice shapes the direction of the narrative.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/ff3e8e6d85c96611e77676f3bddf61ff.poster.avif?t=1716399009\" width=614 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/ff3e8e6d85c96611e77676f3bddf61ff.webm?t=1716399009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870130/extras/ff3e8e6d85c96611e77676f3bddf61ff.mp4?t=1716399009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>",
